    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a start but it feels a bit surface level. can you go deeper into the legal and philosophical side of it? like the actual logic they use regarding state liability or the idea of collective vs individual responsibility? i want to make sure i'm not just writing down \"it's too hard to do.\"",
